这台可不是。
而它的成绩是？
This doesn't.
And it did it in?

1048
00:53:39,320 --> 00:53:40,680
我简直不敢相信。
I cannot believe this.

1049
00:53:40,720 --> 00:53:44,920
湿地，1分27秒2。
In the wet, 1:27.2.

1050
00:53:44,960 --> 00:53:50,880
这简直……瞧瞧这个！
比Evo 8代在干地跑的还要快！这可是……
That's just... Look at that!
That's faster than an Evo VIII
in the dry! That's a...

