If that had been dry,
I don't wanna even think
what it would've done it in.

1052
00:53:54,440 --> 00:53:55,920
-不敢想。
-那绝对得……
-No.
-That's gotta be...

1053
00:53:55,960 --> 00:54:00,840
-总之，
在完成那次惊天动地的飞驰之后……
-嗯？
-Anyway,
after that momentous drive...
-Yeah?

1054
00:54:00,880 --> 00:54:03,800
……他转头
