it beat just about
every supercar on the planet.

1070
00:55:04,800 --> 00:55:06,640
但在这里够用吗？
But is it enough here?

1071
00:55:07,640 --> 00:55:10,200
《壮志凌云》对决《Top Gear》。
Top Gun versusTop Gear.

1072
00:55:11,680 --> 00:55:15,360
200米内冲到时速100英里，
而且跟战斗机飞行员不同的是，
100 miles an hour
in 200 metres
and, unlike the pilot,

